{"kind": "mod", "id": 2319, "name": "SPTRealism Giga Patch Pack", "slug": "sptrealism-giga-patch-pack", "teaser": "WTT Armory update", "owner_name": "Kojimbo0_0", "downloads": 5907, "favourites": 2, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "Mozilla Public License 2.0", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Other", "category_id": 17, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:59:09.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:19:59.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-09-21T08:19:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "3.11.4", "latest_version": "1.0.4", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mpl-2.0/", "description_html": "<p>Made for myself first when Realism was getting worked on. Tried to add unique values that make sense and real weights to items. All guns have working masteries. I tweaked vanilla sights - LPVO’s have a ADS boost across the board and are less sluggish. Optic risers have a slight sight picture speed boost at the cost of accuracy as they do IRL.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/33947-devilflippy/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DevilFlippy</a> and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/52449-therkelsen/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Therkelsen</a> ‘s stats from their old patches are included (Epic’s, Massivesoft, WTT)</p>\n<p>It’s not finished, let me know of unbalanced or bugged items. Right now the belts don’t have stats and new ammo is underpowered.</p>\n<p><strong>To do:</strong> Balancing, fix new calibers, LotsOfAmmo support, fix item conflicts and clipping parts.</p>\n<h3><strong>Mods Supported:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2952-wtt-armory/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT- Armory 1.2.1</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\